\pard\sa140\sb340\f0\fs30\b\cf2 Experiment 6 -- NDCG@10 at scale\b0\par
\pard\sa140\f0\fs22\cf1 Answer key: 1,035-query. Runtime 23 minutes on an uncontended GPU, but it degrades badly under sharing -- observed 23 min on a quiet H100 and over 2 hours on a busy one (about 1.3s vs 8s per query). A slow run is not a stuck run: check that adv_errors stays 0 and the query counter keeps advancing. Reuses both Experiment 4/5 ConfigMaps, plus its own.\par
\pard\sa100\sb240\f0\fs24\b\cf1 Step 1 -- ConfigMap\b0\par
\pard\sa140\li240\f0\fs21\b\cf4 NOTE: \b0 The live cyberfaces-eval-ndcg also carries an extra_docs.jsonl key with no repo counterpart; regenerating drops it. That is harmless -- the Job does not set NDCG_EXTRA_DOCS_FILE, so it runs on the documented 336-document corpus either way.\par
\pard\li360\sa0\f1\fs18\cf3 gzip -9 -c ./final_evaluation_dataset_1035q.jsonl > /tmp/gt1035.jsonl.gz\par
\pard\li360\sa0\f1\fs18\cf3 kubectl --context=anvil create configmap cyberfaces-eval-ndcg \\\par
