\pard\sa140\sb340\f0\fs30\b\cf2 Experiment 7 -- AI query expansion for BM25\b0\par
\pard\sa140\f0\fs22\cf1 Answer key: 1,035-query. Runtime 25-60 minutes -- 1,035 sequential AnvilGPT calls, and AnvilGPT latency varies a lot (observed 25 min and 61 min on different days). Needs cyberfaces-hn-code and cyberfaces-hn-data from section 1. This is the lightest GPU consumer of the nine, so it is the best one to attempt when the cluster is busy.\par
