\pard\sa140\f0\fs22\cf1 Experiment 3 -- not run in this pass; its 6-hour runtime queued behind the others. Its documented numbers are independently confirmed by a different route: rescoring the saved per-query rankings in run_results_query_rewrites/ reproduces all sixteen plain-corpus figures exactly. That validates the scoring, not the Job manifest.\par
